      "end_ms": 16709,
      "text_sk": "Počujem Tvoj hlas",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the distance",
      "start_ms": 16709,
      "end_ms": 18653,
      "text_sk": "Aj v diaľke",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the silence",
      "start_ms": 18653,
      "end_ms": 21931,
      "text_sk": "Aj v tichu",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the static",
      "start_ms": 21931,
      "end_ms": 25262,
      "text_sk": "Aj v statike",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I see You move",
      "start_ms": 25262,
      "end_ms": 29785,
      "text_sk": "Vidím Ťa pohybovať sa",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the dark night",
      "start_ms": 29785,
      "end_ms": 31656,
      "text_sk": "Aj v temnej noci",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the half light",
      "start_ms": 31656,
      "end_ms": 34908,
      "text_sk": "Aj v polosvete",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the stillness",
      "start_ms": 34908,
      "end_ms": 38314,
      "text_sk": "Aj v tichu",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "And after the fire",
      "start_ms": 38314,
      "end_ms": 39497,
      "text_sk": "A po ohni",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "And after the wind",
      "start_ms": 39497,
      "end_ms": 40,
      "text_sk": "A po vetre",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "When chaos subsides",
      "start_ms": 40,
      "end_ms": 41,
      "text_sk": "Keď sa chaos utíši",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I listen again",
      "start_ms": 41,
      "end_ms": 42,
      "text_sk": "Znovu počúvam",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "And after the earth shakes",
      "start_ms": 42,
      "end_ms": 43,
      "text_sk": "A keď sa zem trasie",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "You're calling me in",
      "start_ms": 43,
      "end_ms": 44,
      "text_sk": "Voláš ma dnu",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A voice in the quiet",
      "start_ms": 44,
      "end_ms": 45,
      "text_sk": "Hlas v tichu",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "A whisper within",
      "start_ms": 45,
      "end_ms": 46,
      "text_sk": "Šepot vo vnútri",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "When You speak I am still",
      "start_ms": 46,
      "end_ms": 47,
      "text_sk": "Keď hovoríš, som pokojný",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I believe You are near",
      "start_ms": 47,
      "end_ms": 48,
      "text_sk": "Verím, že si blízko",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Speak to me draw me in",
      "start_ms": 48,
      "end_ms": 49,
      "text_sk": "Hovor ku mne, pritiahni ma",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Where You are I'll remain",
      "start_ms": 49,
      "end_ms": 50,
      "text_sk": "Kde si Ty, tam zostanem",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I feel Your love",
      "start_ms": 50,
      "end_ms": 51,
      "text_sk": "Cítim Tvoju lásku",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even in the heartache",
      "start_ms": 51,
      "end_ms": 52,
      "text_sk": "Aj v bolesti srdca",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even though my heart breaks",
      "start_ms": 52,
      "end_ms": 53,
      "text_sk": "Aj keď sa moje srdce láme",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even then Your word stays",
      "start_ms": 53,
      "end_ms": 54,
      "text_sk": "Aj vtedy Tvoje slovo zostáva",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I know You're here",
      "start_ms": 54,
      "end_ms": 55,
      "text_sk": "Viem, že si tu",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even when I'm broken",
      "start_ms": 55,
      "end_ms": 56,
      "text_sk": "Aj keď som zlomený",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Even when I'm hopeless",
      "start_ms": 56,
      "end_ms": 57,
      "text_sk": "Aj keď som beznádejný",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "I know where my hope is",
      "start_ms": 57,
      "end_ms": 58,
      "text_sk": "Viem, kde je moja nádej",
      "words": null
    },
    {
      "text": "When You speak I am still",
      "start_ms": 58,
